{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03140","headline":"初发江陵有怀 · 张九龄","name":"初发江陵有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"极望涔阳浦，江天渺不分。\n扁舟从此去，鸥鸟自爲羣。\n他日怀真赏，中年负俗纷。\n适来果微尚，倏尔会斯文。\n复想金闺籍，何如梦渚云。\n我行多胜寄，浩思独氛氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03140.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03140","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}